    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Radiation Shielding is necessary heavy and bulky. Only a suit of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medium_Armor\" title=\"Medium Armor\">Medium Armor</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Armor\" title=\"Heavy Armor\">Heavy Armor</a> can be modified with Radiation Shielding, and it increases the Armor's weight by 10 kg. The Radiation Shielding grants a +10 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to a wearer's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> attacks, and it reduces any damage dealt by a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> attack by 5 points. In addition, any time you would move -1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent\">Persistent</a> step down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> as a result of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> damage while wearing this Armor, you can make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Endurance\" title=\"Endurance\">Endurance</a> check to negate the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a>. You can make this check only the first time you move down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> due to a particular <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> Hazard; if you fail, you must have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> cured normal (see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Radiation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Treat Radiation\">Treat Radiation</a>). </p>",
